@div sa-gida A

A.1. en ni₂ guru₆ an# [ki kalam-ma pa e₃-a]
#tr.en: Lord who inspires awe in heaven and on earth,
#lem: en[lord]; ni[fear]; gur[lift]; an[sky]; ki[place]; kalam[the Land (of Sumer)]; pa[branch]; e[leave]
#etcsl: line-id=A.1

A.2. nam-lugal-še₃ [a]-a-zu# [tud-da]
#tr.en: who is resplendent in the Land, engendered for kingship by your father,
#lem: namlugal[kingship]; aya[father]; utud[give birth (to)]
#etcsl: line-id=A.2

A.3. saŋ gig₂-ga ni₂-zu mi-ni-[ri]
#tr.en: your awesomeness weighs upon the black-headed. The @wDN{Anuna}, the great gods,
#lem: saŋ[head]; giggig[black]; ni[fear]; ri[impose]
#etcsl: line-id=A.3

A.4. {d}a-nun-na diŋir gal-gal-[e-ne]
#tr.en: cower together before your awesomeness and radiance.
#lem: Anunak[1]DN; diŋir[deity]; gal[big]
#etcsl: line-id=A.4

A.5. ni₂# me#-lem₄-zu-de₃ teš₂ ši-im-da-šar₂#-[re-ne]
#tr.en: @wDN{Nergal}, lord who inspires awe in heaven and on earth,
#lem: ni[fear]; melim[frightening splendor]; teš[unity]; šar[mix]
#etcsl: line-id=A.5

A.6. {d}nergal en ni₂ guru₆ an ki kalam-ma pa e₃-a
#tr.en: who is resplendent in the Land,
#lem: Nergal[1]DN; en[lord]; ni[fear]; gur[lift]; an[sky]; ki[place]; kalam[the Land (of Sumer)]; pa[branch]; e[leave]
#etcsl: line-id=A.6

A.7. nam-lugal#-še₃ a-a-zu tud-da
#tr.en: engendered for kingship by your father,
#lem: namlugal[kingship]; aya[father]; utud[give birth (to)]
#etcsl: line-id=A.7

A.8. saŋ# [gig₂]-ga# ni₂-zu mi-ni-ri
#tr.en: your awesomeness weighs upon the black-headed.
#lem: saŋ[head]; giggig[black]; ni[fear]; ri[impose]
#etcsl: line-id=A.8

A.9. {d}[a]-nun#-na diŋir gal-gal-e-ne
#tr.en: The @wDN{Anuna}, the great gods,
#lem: Anunak[1]DN; diŋir[deity]; gal[big]
#etcsl: line-id=A.9

A.10. [ni₂ me]-lem₄-zu-ta teš₂ ši-im-da-šar₂-re-ne
#tr.en: cower together before your awesomeness and radiance.
#lem: ni[fear]; melim[frightening splendor]; teš[unity]; šar[mix]
#etcsl: line-id=A.10

A.11. [ur-saŋ] ud a-a-zu in-tud-de₃-en-na-ta
#tr.en: Hero, after your father begot you, your father @wDN{Enlil} bestowed on you the mountain of the earth and all of the people.
#lem: ursaŋ[warrior]; ud[sun]; aya[father]; utud[give birth (to)]
#etcsl: line-id=A.11

A.12. hur-saŋ# ki-a uŋ₃ gu₂ si-a
#tr.en: He definitively handed the deciding of destinies to you.
#lem: hursaŋ[mountain]; ki[place]; uŋ[people]; gu[neck]; si[fill]
#etcsl: line-id=A.12

A.13. [a-a-zu] {d}en-lil₂-le saŋ-e-eš mu-ri-in-rig₇
#tr.en: Hero, @wDN{Nergal}, you are their king! @wDN{Nergal},
#lem: aya[father]; Enlil[1]DN; saŋ[head]; rig[donate]
#etcsl: line-id=A.13

A.14. nam tar-re-de₃ šu-za ma-ra-ni-in-ge-en
#tr.en: hero,
#lem: nam[fate]; tar[cut]; šu[hand]; gin[confirm]
#etcsl: line-id=A.14

